h began commercial operation between June 2007 and December 2018 - are Gidropress VVER units supplied by Russia. Units 5 and 6 both feature Chinese ACPR1000 reactors.\nIn January, CNNC announced that hot tests had been completed at unit 7 on 30 December.",
