        "title": "Despite al-Jolani’s appeasement, Israel strikes Syrian airfield, warning Ankara",
        "link": "https://www.tehrantimes.com/news/529201/Despite-al-Jolani-s-appeasement-Israel-strikes-Syrian-airfield",
