        "title": "Big changes: Google reportedly plans to exit China in 2027 to produce Pixel line in India, Vietnam",
        "link": "https://www.androidcentral.com/phones/google-pixel/google-reportedly-plans-to-exit-china-in-2027-produce-pixel-line-in-india-vietnam",
