        "title": "Navigation API - a better way to navigate, is now Baseline Newly Available",
        "link": "https://web.dev/blog/baseline-navigation-api?hl=en",
        "source": "web.dev: Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.419320+00:00",
