        "title": "Deep learning for single-cell sequencing: a microscope to see the diversity of cells",
        "link": "https://thegradient.pub/deep-learning-for-single-cell-sequencing-a-microscope-to-uncover-the-rich-diversity-of-individual-cells/",
        "source": "The Gradient",
