        "title": "After Orthogonality: Virtue-Ethical Agency and AI Alignment",
        "link": "https://thegradient.pub/virtue-ethics-ai-alignment/",
        "source": "The Gradient",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.419155+00:00",
