        "title": "Why Apple’s camera-equipped AirPods may not be the ‘pervert pods’ consumers fear",
        "link": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/18/why-apples-camera-equipped-airpods-may-not-be-the-pervert-pods-consumers-fear/",
