        "full_content": "Watch: Flash flood sweeps vehicle away in Hawaii after Hurricane Lala\nHawaii has been hit by flash floods and mudslides that have swept away homes after category one Hurricane Lala skirted Big Island over the weekend, leaving one person dead.\nHeavy rains and winds were strong enough to sweep around 100 homes off their foundations on the Big Island, officials said. More than 200,000 households were without power.\nOfficials say the tropical storm is predicted to progress west for the next couple of days.\nRead more about Hurricane Lala here.\nRelated topics\n- FloodsUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n- Severe weatherUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n- United StatesUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n- HawaiiUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n- HurricanesUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
