        "title": "Cloudy skies lead to mixed fortunes for Scotland's eclipse hunters",
        "link": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c5y49e2z8yno?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
        "source": "BBC News",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.418837+00:00",
