        "title": "S Jaishankar, Nirmala Sitharaman, Piyush Goyal to travel to Singapore for crucial talks",
        "link": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/s-jaishankar-nirmala-sitharaman-piyush-goyal-to-travel-to-singapore-for-crucial-talks/articleshow/133325724.cms",
