        "title": "Govt brings incentive scheme to accelerate household piped gas connections",
        "link": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/govt-brings-incentive-scheme-to-accelerate-household-piped-gas-connections/articleshow/133328048.cms",
        "source": "India-News-Economic Times",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.417938+00:00",
