        "title": "Institute of Chartered Accountants of India holds public finance workshop for 100 West Bengal MLAs",
        "link": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/institute-of-chartered-accountants-of-india-holds-public-finance-workshop-for-100-west-bengal-mlas/articleshow/133327800.cms",
