        "full_content": "A man and woman have been charged with murder after an alleged stabbing south of Brisbane on Tuesday.\nEmergency services were called to reports of an altercation between three people at a house on Lubach Street at Beenleigh about 4:45pm.\nPolice will allege the woman stabbed a 66-year-old man in the altercation.\nOfficers attempted CPR but the man was declared dead shortly after they arrived.\nA 47-year-old Karalee man has been charged with murder and a 43-year-old Beenleigh woman has been charged with murder and other offences.\nPolice said all three people knew each other.\nQueensland Ambulance Service said a man in his 40s with an arm wound and an uninjured woman were both taken to hospital.",
