        "title": "Live: Mushroom killer Erin Patterson appeals murder conviction",
        "link": "https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-08-19/live-blog-erin-patterson-appeal-day-1/107050704",
        "source": "Just In",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.417751+00:00",
