        "title": "ABC sues U.S. broadcast regulator over early licence reviews, calling it an 'existential threat'",
        "link": "https://www.cbc.ca/news/world/abc-fcc-lawsuit-9.7311327?cmp=rss",
        "source": "CBC | Top Stories News",
