    {
        "title": "Zambia: President Hichilema Re-Elected Amid Tensions - Bishops Call for Transparency and Respect for the Rule of Law",
        "link": "https://allafrica.com/stories/202608180667.html",
        "source": "AllAfrica News: Latest",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
