        "full_content": "Where to Watch ‘Sterling Point’ Online for Free\nFrom the creator of My Old Ass, Sterling Point follows New Yorker Annie Jacobson (Ella Rubin) as she heads to a Canadian island recently left to her by a grandfather she never knew, and begins uncovering long-buried family secrets. The eight-episode Prime exclusive, written and directed by Megan Park, is the latest Canadian production to make waves with audiences around the world.\nIn November 2025, the TV adaptation of Rachel Reid’s 2019 novel Heated Rivalry became a major talking point on social media and at water coolers, following in the footsteps of Schitt’s Creek, which ran for six seasons and collected numerous major television awards. Now, Sterling Point is carrying the torch with its lakeside teen drama that brings mystery, love, lust, betrayal, hate-love relationships, stunning Canadian views, and major summer vacation inspiration.\nWhere to Stream Sterling Point Online\nReleased Aug. 5, Sterling Point is a Prime Video original series. All eight episodes of the coming-of-age drama are now available to stream, making Prime the exclusive destination for viewers looking to binge-watch. Currently ranked Number Two in the U.S. on the platform, the full season is accessible with an active Amazon Prime membership.\nHow to Watch Sterling Point for Free\nIf you are already a Prime member, simply sign in to Prime Video with your Amazon account, and you can start streaming Sterling Point. If you don’t have an account, new subscribers who qualify for Amazon’s 30-day Prime free trial can also use the trial to access Prime Video and watch the series without paying during the trial period. The offer is limited to eligible customers, and membership will automatically continue as a paid subscription after the trial ends unless it is canceled beforehand.\nShop Fan-Made Sterling Point Merch\nSince there isn’t official Sterling Point merch available yet, fans have taken it upon themselves to create witty items that viewers can appreciate. Alternatively, Amazon has curated a list of Sterling Point-inspired clothing, shoes, and accessories that nod to the coastal summer aesthetic of the Canadian island.\nAfter Ramona returns to the fictional island of Sterling Point, she and her group of friends clean the boats of the snotty rich folks vacationing on the island, wearing “Sterling Point Marina” T-shirts given to the crew by Ellis. Now you can be part of the squad with this fan-made graphic tee.\nThe “will they, won’t they” dynamic between Annie and Ellis builds up for several episodes until they finally satisfy viewers with a steamy scene on the floor of a closet. Light this fan-made candle when you have your own rendezvous. All candles from this seller are handmade from soy wax and poured into an amber or clear jar. Choose from vanilla bean, fresh balsam, honeysuckle, sea breeze, spiced pumpkin, pink grapefruit, eucalyptus, comfort spice, or unscented.",
