        "title": "TMNT: Splintered Fate Ver. 2.0 Update Caps Off The Main Story With A New Final Boss",
        "link": "https://www.nintendolife.com/news/2026/08/tmnt-splintered-fate-ver-2-0-update-caps-off-the-main-story-with-a-new-final-boss",
