        "title": "Battlefield 6 is hosting a free trial, just in time for Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4's beta",
        "link": "https://www.eurogamer.net/battlefield-6-free-trial-call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-beta",
        "source": "Eurogamer.net Latest Articles Feed",
