    {
        "title": "How ‘A Knight of the Seven Kingdoms,’ ‘Fallout’ and ‘Spider-Noir’ Production Designers Built Out Their Worlds While Honoring the Source Material",
        "link": "https://variety.com/2026/artisans/features/knight-seven-kingdoms-fallout-spider-noir-production-designers-1236837481/",
        "source": "Variety",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416992+00:00",
