        "title": "‘Heroes’ Creator Tim Kring Pays Tribute to Hayden Panettiere as a ‘Singularly Talented Actor’ With a ‘Deep Understanding of Human Nature’",
        "link": "https://variety.com/2026/tv/news/heroes-tim-kring-tribute-hayden-panettiere-1236837796/",
        "source": "Variety",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416970+00:00",
