        "title": "Beth Behrs Joins ABC’s ‘Shifting Gears’ for a ‘2 Broke Girls’ Reunion",
        "link": "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/tv/tv-news/shifting-gears-beth-behrs-2-broke-girls-kat-dennings-1236676386/",
        "source": "The Hollywood Reporter",
