        "full_content": "If you purchase an independently reviewed product or service through a link on our website, The Hollywood Reporter may receive an affiliate commission.\nMarilyn Monroe’s 100th birthday celebration, taking on the name of MM100, is marked by a growing collection of authorized merchandise in partnership with the Estate of Marilyn Monroe. The limited-edition product lineup is largely made up of collaborations with fashion, home and beauty brands — SharkNinja, Nine West and Aurate, amongst others — along with a very special Aug. 18 launch from Mattel: Marilyn Monroe’s 100th Birthday Barbie.\nFor photography lovers, fine-art photography company Sonic Editions unveiled a new collection of rare and never-seen-before images of Monroe.\nMonroe in May 1953 by Alfred Eisenstaedt / Life Picture Collection\nPrice varies by size and frame selection.\nIn a similar vein, Marilyn Monroe 100, a 348-page coffee table book, is the only official photography-based publication to commemorate the centenary of Marilyn Monroe’s birth. Created, once again, in association with the Marilyn Monroe Estate, the stunning hardcover is the ultimate collector’s item.\nMarilyn Monroe 100: The Official Centenary Book (The Marilyn Monroe Collection)\nThe oversized hardcover book features gilded edges and gold printing, with 275 photographs by the giants of 20th century photography.\nSee below for more of the official MM100 product launches, available while supplies last.\nSharkNinja x Marilyn Monroe 100\nSharkNinka’s Marilyn Monroe Collection welcomes seven of the brand’s best-sellers across beauty, home and kitchen, in limited-edition colorways inspired by the icon. See here for the full assortment, including hair tools, small appliances and beauty devices.\nNinja SLUSHi Marilyn Monroe Collection Frozen Drink Maker\nFeatured in Marilyn Monroe’s Stone & Gold colorway.\nNine West x Marilyn Monroe 100\nThe collection features four statement styles in white, red, silver and black.\nNine West x Marilyn Monroe Vixxie Stiletto Dress Sandals\nAlso available in white and red satin.\nAurate x Marilyn Monroe 100\nThe fine jewelry collaboration captures Monroe’s legendary glamour with gold, pearls, red rubies and white sapphires.\nAurate x Marilyn Monroe Lab Grown Red Marquise Earring Threader\nGold vermeil with lab grown white sapphire and red ruby.\nKat the Label x Marilyn Monroe 100\nThe lineup spans lingerie and lingerie-inspired clothing.\nMontblanc x Marilyn Monroe\nThe design of Montbalnc’s Marilyn Monroe Special Edition Pen is inspired by her iconic Ferragamo high-heels, the color refers to her signature lipstick (Ruby Tuesday by Max Factor) and the clip’s pearl and shape recalls the jewelry she wore.\nMontblanc Marilyn Monroe Special Edition Ballpoint Pen\nIncludes free personalization.\nPiper-Heidsieck x Marilyn Monrow\nA bold portrait of Monroe covers the limited-edition Cuvée Brut.\nPiper-Heidsieck Cuvée Brut Marilyn Monroe Edition\n50% Pinot Noir, 30% Pinot Meunier, 20% Chardonnay.\nMattel x Marilyn Monroe\nMonroe’s 100th Birthday Barbie recreates her look from the “Diamonds Are a Girl’s Best Friend” musical number in the 1953 film Gentlemen Prefer Blondes.\nBarbie Marilyn Monroe Signature Collectible Doll\nFeatures matching gloves and “diamonds” that sparkle throughout.\nThe Caviar Co. x Marilyn Monroe\nThe limited-edition caviar set includes an engraved crystal caviar server, a Marilyn Monroe-inspired red presentation box, a red mother-of-pearl spoon and a custom silver engraved tin key featuring Monroe’s signature. When purchasing the set, customers have the choice of either a 125 g tin or 1 oz jar of privately labeled Classic White Sturgeon caviar or the option to purchase the set sans the caviar.\nMarilyn Monroe x The Caviar Co. Signature Caviar Set\nAvailable for a limited time only.\nNoon & Moon ✕ Marilyn Monroe\nChoose between two limited-edition Marilyn Monroe-inspired collections: Hollywood Bloom and the Romance Edit.\nNoon & Moon Marilyn Monroe Romance Edit Limited Edition Blue Tea Set\nIncludes one teapot, two tea cups and two saucers.",
