        "title": "‘The Pitt’s Sepideh Moafi Will Be “Running A Tight Ship” In Season 3",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/the-pitt-season-3-sepideh-moafi-interview-1237043457/",
        "source": "Deadline",
