        "title": "‘The Pitt’ Production Designer Nina Ruscio Talks Expanding The ER For Season 2 & World-Building Through Furniture",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/the-pitt-production-designer-interview-season-2-1237044580/",
        "source": "Deadline",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416934+00:00",
