        "title": "How A Tray Of Bloody Oysters Helped ‘The Diplomat’ Find “A Real Spine” For Season 4 – The Backstory",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/the-diplomat-netflix-creative-team-interview-1237044316/",
        "source": "Deadline",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416930+00:00",
