        "title": "Building GNOME Apps with Rust, Part 6: Fetching Feeds",
        "link": "https://dev.to/fromthearchitect/building-gnome-apps-with-rust-part-6-fetching-feeds-bjf",
        "source": "DEV Community",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416770+00:00",
