    {
        "title": "The Shifting Line Between CSS States and JavaScript Events",
        "link": "https://css-tricks.com/css-states-and-javascript-events/",
        "source": "CSS-Tricks",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416746+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-19T00:00:28.648258+00:00",
