        "title": "What’s !important #17: Custom Highlight API, CSS Navigation Matching, Fixing text-stroke, and More",
        "link": "https://css-tricks.com/whats-important-17/",
        "source": "CSS-Tricks",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416700+00:00",
