        "title": "Thinking to recall: How reasoning unlocks parametric knowledge in LLMs",
        "link": "https://research.google/blog/thinking-to-recall-how-reasoning-unlocks-parametric-knowledge-in-llms/",
        "source": "The latest research from Google",
