        "title": "Towards demystifying the creativity of diffusion models",
        "link": "https://research.google/blog/towards-demystifying-the-creativity-of-diffusion-models/",
        "source": "The latest research from Google",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416661+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-19T00:00:28.648174+00:00",
