        "title": "Drip marketing: 11 common types (with examples)",
        "link": "https://zapier.com/blog/drip-marketing",
        "source": "The Zapier Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416556+00:00",
