        "title": "How to use Inspect Element in Chrome, Safari, and Firefox",
        "link": "https://zapier.com/blog/inspect-element-tutorial",
        "source": "The Zapier Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416539+00:00",
