        "title": "Deliver Secure and Reliable OTPs with Twilio Verify and PingOne",
        "link": "https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/developers/tutorials/integrations/pingone-custom-server-mfa-verify",
        "source": "Twilio Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.416511+00:00",
