        "title": "Build Persistent Customer Memory with Twilio Agent Connect and Conversation Intelligence",
        "link": "https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/developers/tutorials/product/build-persistent-customer-memory-with-twilio-agent-connect-and-c",
        "source": "Twilio Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
