        "title": "MLSysBook.AI: Principles and Practices of Machine Learning Systems Engineering",
        "link": "https://blog.tensorflow.org/2024/11/mlsysbookai-principles-and-practices-of-machine-learning-systems-engineering.html",
        "source": "The TensorFlow Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
