        "title": "Protecting your Supabase projects from npm supply chain attacks",
        "link": "https://supabase.com/blog/protecting-your-supabase-projects-from-npm-supply-chain-attacks",
        "source": "Supabase Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
