        "title": "Symlinks Are Still Scary (And Yes, You Can Commit Them to Git)",
        "link": "https://snyk.io/blog/symlinks-are-still-scary/",
        "source": "Blog RSS Feed | Snyk",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.415974+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-19T00:00:28.647755+00:00",
