        "title": "Secure at Inception: Announcing the Snyk Studio Integration for Snowflake Cortex Code",
        "link": "https://snyk.io/blog/announcing-snyk-studio-integration-snowflake-cortex-code/",
        "source": "Blog RSS Feed | Snyk",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.415958+00:00",
