        "title": "Why Is Collaboration Important in the Workplace?",
        "link": "https://slack.com/blog/collaboration/why-is-collaboration-important",
        "source": "Slack Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.415905+00:00",
