        "title": "Breaking free from lock-in: How a leading insurance provider migrated 1,500 workloads to ROSA in 10 months",
        "link": "https://www.redhat.com/en/blog/breaking-free-lock-how-leading-insurance-provider-migrated-1500-workloads-rosa-10-months",
        "source": "Red Hat Blog",
