        "image": "https://wpblogassets.paytm.com/paytmblog/uploads/2026/08/Paytm-Spend-Summary-Blog-1.jpg.jpeg",
        "full_content": "Salary day has a special kind of happiness.\nYou check your bank balance, feel rich for approximately five minutes, and suddenly start planning everything. A few food orders here, some shopping there, weekend plans, subscriptions, bills, and before you know it, you are staring at your account wondering:\nWait… where did my salary go?\nIf this sounds familiar, you are definitely not alone.\nKeeping track of mobile payments can get confusing when you are making multiple payments throughout the month. That ₹200 lunch, ₹500 cab ride, ₹1,000 shopping order and all those “it’s just a small amount” moments can quickly add up.\nThis is where Paytm Spend Summary can help.\nSee Where Your Money Is Going\nWith Paytm Spend Summary, you can get a clearer picture of your spending through your Paytm UPI payments.\nInstead of trying to remember every payment you made, you can view a summary of your spends and understand where your money has been going.\nThat means fewer “How did I spend this much?” moments and more clarity around your monthly spending.\nBecause honestly, knowing you spent money is one thing. Knowing where you spent it is where things start getting interesting.\nYour Monthly Spending, Summed Up\nWe all have that one category where we think we spend very little.\n“I’m not ordering food that often.”\n“I barely shop.”\n“My weekend plans aren’t that expensive.”\nAnd then your Paytm Spend Summary enters the chat with receipts. Literally. 👀\nPaytm Spend Summary helps you get an overview of your payments, making it easier to understand your spending patterns over time.\nMaybe those quick coffee runs are adding up. Maybe your weekend outings deserve their own budget. Or maybe you are actually doing better than you thought.\nEither way, it helps you see the bigger picture.\nA Better Way to Stay on Top of Your Spending\nManaging money does not always mean creating complicated spreadsheets or tracking every single expense manually.\nSometimes, you just need a simple overview.\nBy checking your Paytm Spend Summary regularly, you can understand your spending habits and make more informed decisions about how you want to manage your money.\nWhether you are trying to save more, plan your monthly budget or simply want to know where your salary disappeared, having visibility into your payments can make a difference.\nHow to Check Your Spend Summary on Paytm\nChecking your Spend Summary is simple:\n- Open the Paytm app and go to Balance & History.\n- Tap on Total Spend.\n- You can view your overall spending and see your payments across different categories.\nAnd just like that, you get a clearer picture of where your money has been going.\nSo the next time you look at your bank balance and wonder, “Where did my salary go?”, you might finally have the answer. Because sometimes the mystery is not your salary. It is those “just one small payment” moments.\nCheck your Paytm Spend Summary on the Paytm app today.",
