        "title": "Microsoft named a Leader in the 2026 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for AI-Augmented Code Modernization Tools",
        "link": "https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-named-a-leader-in-the-2026-gartner-magic-quadrant-for-ai-augmented-code-modernization-tools/",
        "source": "Microsoft Azure Blog",
