        "title": "When Escape Routes Become Toll Roads: Mapping How Developers Move Between Programming Languages",
        "link": "https://blog.jetbrains.com/research/2026/08/programming-language-migration/",
        "source": "The JetBrains Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.415220+00:00",
