        "title": "Gemini API Managed Agents: 3.6 Flash, hooks, and more",
        "link": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/expanding-managed-agents-gemini-api-3-6-flash-hooks/",
        "source": "AI",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.415096+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-19T00:00:28.646790+00:00",
