        "title": "The latest AI news we announced in July 2026",
        "link": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/google-ai-updates-july-2026/",
        "source": "AI",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.415089+00:00",
