        "title": "How to govern agentic AI, MCPs, and AI code assistants",
        "link": "https://about.gitlab.com/blog/govern-agentic-ai-mcps-code-assistants/",
        "source": "GitLab",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.415018+00:00",
