        "title": "Empowering India’s next generation of innovators with ATL Saathi",
        "link": "https://deepmind.google/blog/empowering-indias-next-generation-of-innovators-with-atl-saathi/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind News",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
