        "title": "Introducing Gemini 3.6 Flash, 3.5 Flash-Lite, and 3.5 Flash Cyber",
        "link": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-3-6-flash-3-5-flash-lite-and-3-5-flash-cyber/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind News",
