        "title": "From ranking to recommended: get your site ready to thrive in the age of AI agents",
        "link": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/aeo/",
        "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.414737+00:00",
