    {
        "title": "Apple introduces Siri AI, a profoundly more capable and personal assistant",
        "link": "https://www.apple.com/ca/newsroom/2026/06/apple-introduces-siri-ai-a-profoundly-more-capable-and-personal-assistant/",
        "source": "Apple Newsroom",
