        "title": "Apple announces changes to iOS in Brazil",
        "link": "https://www.apple.com/ca/newsroom/2026/06/apple-announces-changes-to-ios-in-brazil/",
        "source": "Apple Newsroom",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
