        "title": "Beyond the Hardware Hub: How ALC Taipei Turned Computex 2026 into a Milestone for the Apache Way",
        "link": "https://news.apache.org/foundation/entry/beyond-the-hardware-hub-how-alc-taipei-turned-computex-2026-into-a-milestone-for-the-apache-way",
        "source": "The ASF Blog",
