        "title": "Amazon DynamoDB now supports real-time vector search at any scale",
        "link": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/amazon-dynamodb-now-supports-real-time-vector-search-at-any-scale/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
