        "full_content": "OpenAI uses Airtable to surface product risks faster\nUse structured workflows and AI summaries to surface risks, align teams, and keep launches moving with speed and clarity.\nOpenAI uses Airtable AI to surface product risks faster.\n50+\nprojects tracked with weekly AI summaries\nRisk Summary\n15Total Risks\n10Active Risks\n7Critical/High\nCriticalImmediate action required\n0\nHighUrgent attention needed\n7\nMediumMonitor closely\n7\nLowAcceptable risk level\n1\neBay triages 1M+ customer insights in real time\nCentralize feedback, use AI to surface key insights, and turn them into prioritized work—then close the loop with updates that show customers their input drives real improvements.\neBay processes 1M+ customer insights in real-time.\n>90%\nfaster feedback triage\nAggregating customer feedback...\nFeedback Text\nThe app is very user-friendly and I love the new update!\nI had trouble logging in after the last update. Please fix this issue.\nCustomer support was very helpful and resolved my issue quickly.\nThe checkout process is confusing and needs improvement.\nI appreciate the fast delivery and quality packaging.\nThe product description was misleading. I expected something different.\nThe app crashes frequently on my device.\nSentiment\nPositive\nNegative\nPositive\nNegative\nPositive\nNegative\nNegative\nPublicis Media ships campaigns 70% faster\nUnify global campaign workflows, eliminate repetitive work, and move from insight to execution with speed, accuracy, and full visibility.\nPublicis Media accelerated campaign delivery at scale with Airtable.\n70%\nfaster turnaround time\nConcept\nConceptis\nConcept\n1\nRadiant Night Runner\n2\nCustom Color Studio\n3\nCity‑to‑Trail Layer\nPitch\nHigh‑visibility running line featuring neon reflective seams that keep athletes seen at dawn and dusk.\nMix‑and‑match leggings and sports bras—shoppers build their own color‑block sets in store or online.\nConvertible shell jacket that zips from crop