        "title": "Building AI-Powered Observability with Heroku Managed Inference and Agents",
        "link": "https://www.heroku.com/blog/building-ai-powered-observability-with-managed-inference-and-agents/",
        "source": "Heroku",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
