        "title": "How India's private hospitals are expanding in different forms",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/magazine/cover-story/story/how-indias-private-hospitals-are-expanding-in-different-forms-549606-2026-08-17?utm_source=rssfeed",
        "source": "Business News India: Latest Business News Today, Share Market, Economy",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T23:58:47.413848+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-19T00:00:28.645485+00:00",
