    {
        "title": "David Sacks says Anthropic’s Dario Amodei wants a ‘DMV for AI.’ But plenty of industries thrive despite safety regulation",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/david-sacks-says-anthropics-dario-amodei-wants-a-dmv-for-ai-but-plenty-of-industries-thrive-despite-safety-regulation/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
