        "title": "The U.S. built its brand by attracting the world’s best and brightest. It must not lose that advantage",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/us-built-brand-attracting-talent-must-not-lose-advantage-china/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
