        "title": "'Comma splices' to 'smartwatch': Nancy Guthrie ransom notes show repeated writing quirks that may help identify suspect",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/comma-splices-to-smartwatch-nancy-guthrie-ransom-notes-show-repeated-writing-quirks-that-may-help-identify-suspect-11787070073408.html",
